---
import SocialIcons from "../../commons/socialIcons/socialIcons.jsx";
import TypeEfect from "../header/typeEfect.jsx";
---

<header class="relative h-screen bg-gray-950 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 grid grid-cols-2">
    <div
      class="animate-gradientMove h-80 bg-linear-to-br from-[#c0c4ca] to-[#2e3961] opacity-35 blur-[120px]"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="animate-gradientMove2 h-80 bg-linear-to-br from-[#9ba1b0] to-[#0a1647] opacity-35 blur-[120px]"
    >
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center h-full text-center px-4"
  >
    <p class="mb-4 mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-(--border) px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-white md:text-sm">
      <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#2e9e5b]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      Disponible para nuevas oportunidades
    </p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white text-shadow">
      Hola! soy Pablo
    </h1>

    <TypeEfect client:visible />

    <p
      class="text-xs md:text-xl text-white max-w-sm md:max-w-xl font-semibold mt-3"
    >
      Construyo software de punta a punta: APIs, interfaces web, apps móviles y la
      infraestructura donde corren. Revisa lo que estoy desarrollando ahora o escríbeme.
    </p>
    <SocialIcons client:visible />
    <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
    <a
      href="/proyectos"
      class="px-6 py-3 bg-primary hover:bg-secondary text-force-white font-semibold rounded-3xl transition-all duration-150
         drop-shadow-[2px_2px_0_#0debd8] active:translate-0.5 active:drop-shadow-none"
    >
      Ver proyectos
    </a>
    <a
      target="_blank"
      href="/cv.pdf"
      class="px-6 py-3 bg-primary hover:bg-secondary text-force-white font-semibold rounded-3xl transition-all duration-150
         drop-shadow-[2px_2px_0_#0debd8] active:translate-0.5 active:drop-shadow-none"
    >
      Mi CV
    </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
